00:03:29.924 --> 00:03:33.521
So bananas are from Southeast
Asia, but like 400 years ago,

00:03:33.521 --> 00:03:35.848
Europeans were taking over the world

00:03:35.848 --> 00:03:38.826
and the Portuguese brought
bananas over to the Americas.

00:03:38.826 --> 00:03:40.158
A few hundred years later,

00:03:40.158 --> 00:03:42.403
