00:04:13.604 --> 00:04:18.358
But another crowd favorite
at the expo was the banana.

00:04:18.358 --> 00:04:21.009
Yes, bananas were equally as impressive

00:04:21.009 --> 00:04:23.771
as the telephone at the World's Fair.

00:04:23.771 --> 00:04:26.891
The banana business started
booming in the United States.

00:04:26.891 --> 00:04:29.807
Much of these bananas flowing
in from New York City.

00:04:29.807 --> 00:04:33.418
The port there was dubbed
Banana Docks for a while

00:04:33.418 --> 00:04:35.373
